        String rda_jra3q_tape_history "For data prior to 1 January 2022, JMA shipped JRA-3Q and JRA-3Q-COBE data on 3 LTO-5 and 107 LTO-6 tapes to Chi-Fan Shih (NCAR), who forwarded the tapes to a Tape Ark data center located in the United States (1950 N.Stemmons Fwy, Suite 2033, Dallas, TX, 75207) for reading and Globus upload to NCAR HPC storage. Mr. Shih returned the tapes to JMA. The Tape Ark corporate website is https://www.tapeark.com, with headquarters located in Perth, Western Australia (Level 1, 2 Brook Street, East Perth, WA, 6004). (For questions concerning coordination of the JRA-3Q tape archive within JMA, Mr. Hitoshi Sato, Senior Scientific Officer, <sato.hitoshi@met.kishou.go.jp>, has been designated for this purpose.)";
